  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Class Specific Understanding (Shikigami User, optional rule): 2 Breakthroughs, only one.</em></p><p>Your <em>Shikigami Companion</em> or one Shikigami, Cursed Corpse, or a tamed Cursed Spirit you have can use <em>Cursed Strike</em> a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus each day. When using it this way, it benefits from any Awakened Understanding or features that benefit your <em>Cursed Strike</em>. You can switch your <em>Cursed Bond</em> as part of a long rest.</p>"
